@startuml
actor User
boundary "views/declares/index.html.erb" as View
control "DeclaresController" as Controller
entity "Declare Model" as Model
database "Database" as DB

User -> View: Request list of declares
View -> Controller: Send GET /declares request
Controller -> Model: Query all declares
Model -> DB: Fetch list of declares
DB --> Model: Return list of declares
Model --> Controller: Return list of declares
Controller -> View: Render list of declares
View -> User: Display list of declares
@enduml